Output .work/out/05-blocked.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source .work/stage.tape
Type "@all we're adding per-key rate limiting to the gateway. maya take the middleware, omar the 429 state in the client, priya a --rate-limit flag, luca the changelog."
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "@luca publish the limits page tonight"
Enter
Sleep 12s
Show
Sleep 2s

# Two agents are waiting on you, and the roster has ranked both to the top in
# amber. ^X goes to the next one that needs you, wherever it is; again, the one
# after.
Ctrl+X
Sleep 4s
Ctrl+X
Sleep 4s

# A permission is armed with its rune and settled with Enter. ^X then goes back
# to the one still waiting.
Type "a"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Ctrl+X
Sleep 3s
Type "a"
Sleep 1500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
